#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:1
msgid "The color management settings in Krita."
msgstr "Nastavitve upravljanja barv v Kriti."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:12
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Nastavitve"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:12
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:12
msgid "Color Management"
msgstr "Upravljanje z barvami"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:12
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Barva"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:12
msgid "Softproofing"
msgstr "Preverjanje videza pred izdajo"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:17
msgid "Color Management Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve upravljanja barv"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:20
msgid ".. image:: images/preferences/Krita_Preferences_Color_Management.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/preferences/Krita_Preferences_Color_Management.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:21
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Krita offers extensive functionality for color management, utilising `Little "
"CMS <http://www.littlecms.com/>`_ We describe Color Management in a more "
"overall level here: :ref:`color_managed_workflow`."
msgstr ""
"Krita ponuja obsežno funkcionalnost za upravljanje barv, z uporabo 'Little "
"CMS <http://www.littlecms.com/>'_ Opisujemo Upravljanje barv v bolj splošni "
"ravni tukaj: :ref:'color_managed_workflow'."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:25
msgid "General"
msgstr "Splošno"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:28
msgid "Default Color Model For New Images"
msgstr "Pivzeti barvni model za nove slike"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:30
msgid "Choose the default model you prefer for all your images."
msgstr "Izberite želeni privzeti model za vse slike."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:33
msgid "When Pasting Into Krita From Other Applications"
msgstr "Ob lepljenju v Krito iz drugih programov"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:35
msgid ""
"The user can define what kind of conversion, if any, Krita will do to an "
"image that is copied from other applications i.e. Browser, GIMP, etc."
msgstr ""
"Uporabnik lahko določi, kakšno pretvorbo (če obstaja) bo Krita opravila s "
"sliko, ki jo kopirate iz drugih programov, kot npr. brskalnika, GIMP-a itn."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:37
msgid "Assume sRGB"
msgstr "Predpostavi sRGB"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:38
msgid ""
"This option will show the pasted image in the default Krita ICC profile of "
"sRGB."
msgstr ""
"Ta možnost bo prikazala prilepljeno sliko v privzetem profilu sRGB ICC Krite."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:39
msgid "Assume monitor profile"
msgstr "Predpostavi profil zaslona"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:40
msgid ""
"This option will show the pasted image in the monitor profile selected in "
"system preferences."
msgstr ""
"Ta možnost bo prikazala prilepljeno sliko v profilu zaslona, izbranem v "
"sistemskih nastavitvah."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:42
msgid "Ask each time"
msgstr "Vedno vprašaj"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:42
msgid ""
"Krita will ask the user each time an image is pasted, what to do with it. "
"This is the default."
msgstr ""
"Krita vpraša uporabnika vsakič, ko prilepi sliko, kaj naj stori z njo. To je "
"privzeto."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:46
msgid ""
"When copying and pasting in Krita color information is always preserved."
msgstr ""
"Ko kopirate / lepite znotraj Krite, se barvne informacije vedno ohranijo."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:49
msgid "Use Blackpoint Compensation"
msgstr "Uporabi kompenzacijo črne točke"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:51
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This option will turn on Blackpoint Compensation for the conversion. BPC is "
"explained by the maintainer of LCMS as following:"
msgstr ""
"Ta možnost vklopi Blackpoint Compensation za konverzijo. Vzdrževalec "
"zdravila LCMS BPC razlaga tako:"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:53
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"BPC is a sort of \"poor man's\" gamut mapping. It basically adjust contrast "
"of images in a way that darkest tone of source device gets mapped to darkest "
"tone of destination device. If you have an image that is adjusted to be "
"displayed on a monitor, and want to print it on a large format printer, you "
"should realize printer can render black significantly darker that the "
"screen. So BPC can do the adjustment for you. It only makes sense on "
"Relative colorimetric intent. Perceptual and Saturation does have an "
"implicit BPC."
msgstr ""
"BPC je nekakšna preslikava gamuta »za reveže«. V bistvu prilagodi kontrast "
"slik na način, da je najtemnejši barvni ton izvorne naprave preslikan v "
"najtemnejši ton ciljne naprave. Če imate sliko, ki je prilagojena za prikaz "
"na zaslonu in jo želite natisniti na tiskalniku velikih mer, se morate "
"zavedati, da lahko tiskalnik naredi črno bistveno temnejšo kot zaslon. Tako "
"lahko BPC opravi prilagoditev namesto vas. Smiselna je le za relativne "
"kolorimetrične namene. Zaznavno in nasičenost imata implicitni BPC."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:56
msgid "Allow LittleCMS optimizations"
msgstr "Dovoli optimizacije LittleCMS"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:58
msgid ""
"Uncheck this option to turn off optimizations. Sometimes, in case of working "
"with linear colorspaces, the optimizations Little CMS does will not give the "
"best results."
msgstr ""
"Če želite izklopiti optimizacije, izklopite to možnost. Včasih v primeru "
"dela z linearnim barvnim prostorom optimizacija Little CMS ne bo dala "
"najboljših rezultatov."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:62
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Since Krita 5.0, we ship the `fast-float plugin for LittleCMS <https://www."
"littlecms.com/plugin/>`_. Turning this option off will also turn off the "
"fast float plugin."
msgstr ""
"Od Krite 5.0 vključujemo `hitro-plavajoči vstavek za LittleCMS <https://www."
"littlecms.com/plugin/>`_. Če izklopite to možnost, izklopite tudi vtičnik za "
"hitro plavajočo vejico."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:66
msgid ""
"Enforce palette colors: always select the nearest color from the active "
"palette"
msgstr "Vsili barve palete: vedno izbere najbližjo barvo iz dejavne palete."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:67
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By default, palette selection widgets take the current foreground color, "
"compare it to the swatches in its active palette and highlight the swatch "
"that is nearest to the current foreground color."
msgstr ""
"Pripomočki za izbor palet privzeto vzamejo trenutno barvo v ospredju, jo "
"primerjajo s swatchi v svoji aktivni paleti in poudarijo swatch, ki je "
"najbližji trenutni barvi v ospredju."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:69
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When :guilabel:`Enforce palette colors` option is checked, it switches the "
"internal color selector into a mode in which, instead of just highlighting "
"the swatch, the current foreground color is replaced with the color of the "
"nearest swatch."
msgstr ""
"Ko je izbrana možnost :guilabel:'Enforce palette colors', preklopi notranji "
"izbirnik barv v način, v katerem se namesto samo poudarjanja swatcha "
"trenutna barva v ospredju nadomesti z barvo najbližjega swatcha."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:73
msgid "Display"
msgstr "Zaslon"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:75
msgid "Use System Monitor Profile"
msgstr "Uporabi sistemski profil zaslona"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:76
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This option when selected will tell Krita to use the ICC profile selected in "
"your system preferences."
msgstr ""
"Ta možnost, ko je izbrana, bo kriti povedala, naj uporabi profil ICC, izbran "
"v vaših sistemskih nastavitvah."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:77
msgid "Screen Profiles"
msgstr "Profili zaslona"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:78
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are as many of these as you have screens connected. The user can "
"select an ICC profile which Krita will use independent of the monitor "
"profile set in system preferences. The default is sRGB built-in. On Unix "
"systems, profile stored in $/usr/share/color/icc (system location) or $~/."
"local/share/color/icc (local location) will be proposed. Profile stored in "
"Krita preference folder, $~/.local/share/krita/profiles will be visible only "
"in Krita."
msgstr ""
"Teh je toliko, kot imate priključenih zaslonov. Uporabnik lahko izbere "
"profil ICC, ki ga bo Krita uporabil neodvisno od profila monitorja, "
"nastavljenega v sistemskih nastavitvah. Privzeto je vgrajen sRGB. V unix "
"sistemih bo predlagan profil, shranjen v $/usr/share/color/icc (lokacija "
"sistema) ali $~/.local/share/color/icc (lokalna lokacija). Profil, shranjen "
"v mapi s prednostnimi nastavitvami Krita, bo $~/.local/share/krita/profiles "
"viden samo v Kriti."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:80
msgid "Rendering Intent"
msgstr "Namen upodobitve"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:80
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your choice of rendering intents is a way of telling Littlecms how you want "
"colors mapped from one color space to another. There are four options "
"available, all are explained on the :ref:`icc_profiles` manual page."
msgstr ""
"Vaša izbira učnih namer je način, da poveste Littlecmsu, kako želite, da "
"barve kartiranje iz enega barvnega prostora v drugega. Na voljo so štiri "
"možnosti, vse so pojasnjene na ročni strani :ref:'icc_profiles'."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:83
msgid "Softproofing options"
msgstr "Preverjanje videza pred izdajo"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:85
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These allow you to configure the *default* softproofing options. To "
"configure the actual softproofing for the current image, go to :"
"menuselection:`Image --> Image Properties --> Softproofing` ."
msgstr ""
"S temi možnostmi lahko konfigurirate *privzete* možnosti mehke izolacije. Če "
"želite konfigurirati dejansko mehko izolacijo za trenutno sliko, pojdite na :"
"menuselection:'Image --> Image Properties --> Softproofing' ."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/color_management_settings.rst:87
msgid ""
"For indepth details about how to use softproofing, check out :ref:`the page "
"on softproofing <soft_proofing>`."
msgstr ""
"Za podrobnosti o uporabi preverjanja videza si oglejte :ref:`stran o "
"preverjanju videza <soft_proofing>`."
